{"id":"u06","kelas":7,"no":6,"judul":"Mendeskripsikan Orang dan Benda","title":"Describing People and Things","emoji":"🧑‍🎨","ringkas":"Kata sifat, urutan kata, dan descriptive text sederhana","ready":true,"goals":["mendeskripsikan penampilan: [[tall]], [[short]], [[curly hair]], [[straight hair]]","mendeskripsikan sifat: [[kind]], [[friendly]], [[funny]], [[smart]], [[shy]]","memakai warna dan ukuran untuk mendeskripsikan benda","membuat kalimat dengan [[is / are]] dan [[has / have]]","menyusun urutan kata sifat dengan benar: [[a big red bag]]","menulis descriptive text pendek tentang temanmu"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Bagaimana kamu menceritakan **temanmu** atau **barang kesukaanmu** kepada orang yang belum pernah melihatnya? Kamu pakai kata sifat, yaitu **adjective**. Di **Unit 6** kamu belajar mendeskripsikan orang dan benda, lalu menulis teks deskripsi sederhana."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Penampilan (Appearance)","items":[{"en":"tall","id":"tinggi","ex":"My father is tall."},{"en":"short","id":"pendek / rendah","ex":"My cousin is short."},{"en":"slim","id":"langsing","ex":"She is slim."},{"en":"young","id":"muda","ex":"My aunt is young."},{"en":"old","id":"tua","ex":"My grandfather is old."},{"en":"handsome","id":"tampan","ex":"He is handsome."},{"en":"beautiful","id":"cantik / indah","ex":"She is beautiful."},{"en":"curly hair","id":"rambut keriting","ex":"He has curly hair."},{"en":"straight hair","id":"rambut lurus","ex":"She has straight hair."},{"en":"long hair","id":"rambut panjang","ex":"Rani has long hair."},{"en":"short hair","id":"rambut pendek","ex":"Budi has short hair."},{"en":"glasses","id":"kacamata","ex":"My teacher wears glasses."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Sifat (Personality)","items":[{"en":"kind","id":"baik hati","ex":"My mother is kind."},{"en":"friendly","id":"ramah","ex":"Dina is friendly."},{"en":"funny","id":"lucu","ex":"Tom is funny."},{"en":"smart","id":"pintar","ex":"She is smart."},{"en":"diligent","id":"rajin","ex":"Budi is diligent."},{"en":"lazy","id":"malas","ex":"My cat is lazy."},{"en":"shy","id":"pemalu","ex":"He is shy."},{"en":"polite","id":"sopan","ex":"She is polite."},{"en":"brave","id":"berani","ex":"My brother is brave."},{"en":"helpful","id":"suka menolong","ex":"Our neighbor is helpful."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Warna dan ukuran (Colors and sizes)","items":[{"en":"red","id":"merah","ex":""},{"en":"blue","id":"biru","ex":""},{"en":"green","id":"hijau","ex":""},{"en":"yellow","id":"kuning","ex":""},{"en":"black","id":"hitam","ex":""},{"en":"white","id":"putih","ex":""},{"en":"brown","id":"cokelat","ex":""},{"en":"pink","id":"merah muda","ex":""},{"en":"purple","id":"ungu","ex":""},{"en":"orange","id":"jingga","ex":""},{"en":"big","id":"besar","ex":"A big bag."},{"en":"small","id":"kecil","ex":"A small bag."},{"en":"long","id":"panjang","ex":""},{"en":"new","id":"baru","ex":""},{"en":"old","id":"lama / tua","ex":""}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Memakai is dan are untuk mendeskripsikan","text":"Untuk menyebut **keadaan** (sifat, tinggi, umur), pakai **to be** + adjective. Ingat Unit 2: he/she/it → **is**; I → **am**; you/we/they → **are**.","examples":[{"en":"[[She is tall and slim.]]","id":"Dia tinggi dan langsing."},{"en":"[[My friends are kind and funny.]]","id":"Teman-temanku baik hati dan lucu."},{"en":"[[The bag is new.]]","id":"Tasnya baru."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Adjective tidak pakai -s","text":"Kata sifat **tidak berubah** walaupun bendanya banyak. Benar: [[two big bags]]. Salah: *two bigs bags*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Memakai has dan have untuk bagian tubuh dan ciri","text":"Untuk menyebut ciri yang **dimiliki** (rambut, mata, kacamata), pakai **has** untuk he/she/it dan **have** untuk I/you/we/they.","table":[["Subjek","Kata kerja","Contoh"],["I / you / we / they","**have**","[[I have black hair.]]"],["he / she / it","**has**","[[She has long straight hair.]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[My brother has curly hair and brown eyes.]]","id":"Kakakku berambut keriting dan bermata cokelat."}]},{"t":"warn","title":"Tinggi badan pakai is, rambut pakai has","text":"Benar: [[He is tall.]] dan [[He has short hair.]] Salah: *He has tall* atau *He is short hair*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Urutan kata sifat sebelum benda","text":"Dalam bahasa Inggris, kata sifat berada **sebelum benda** (kebalikan dari bahasa Indonesia: *tas merah* → *a red bag*). Kalau ada lebih dari satu, urutannya:\n**ukuran → umur → warna → benda**","table":[["Indonesia","Inggris"],["tas merah","[[a red bag]]"],["tas merah besar","[[a big red bag]]"],["sepatu putih baru","[[new white shoes]]"],["kucing hitam kecil","[[a small black cat]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"a atau an?","text":"Pakai **an** sebelum bunyi huruf hidup (a, e, i, o, u): [[an old bag]], [[an orange cat]]. Pakai **a** sebelum bunyi lainnya: [[a new bag]]."},{"t":"grammar","title":"7. Bertanya tentang penampilan dan sifat","table":[["Pertanyaan","Menanyakan","Contoh jawaban"],["[[What does she look like?]]","penampilan","She is tall. She has long hair."],["[[What is she like?]]","sifat","She is kind and friendly."],["[[What color is your bag?]]","warna","It's blue."]]},{"t":"h","text":"8. Contoh teks deskripsi (Descriptive text)"},{"t":"p","text":"Teks deskripsi punya dua bagian: **Identification** (siapa atau apa yang dideskripsikan) dan **Description** (ciri-cirinya)."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks: My Best Friend","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"My best friend is Rani. She is twelve years old.","id":"Sahabatku adalah Rani. Dia berumur dua belas tahun. (Identification)"},{"who":"Text","en":"She is tall and slim. She has long straight black hair and brown eyes. She wears glasses.","id":"Dia tinggi dan langsing. Rambutnya hitam, panjang, dan lurus, matanya cokelat. Dia memakai kacamata. (Description: penampilan)"},{"who":"Text","en":"Rani is kind, smart, and very funny. She is always helpful.","id":"Rani baik hati, pintar, dan sangat lucu. Dia selalu suka menolong. (Description: sifat)"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mendeskripsikan teman","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, who is that girl?","id":"Dina, siapa gadis itu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"That's Rani. She is my best friend.","id":"Itu Rani. Dia sahabatku."},{"who":"Tom","en":"What does she look like?","id":"Seperti apa penampilannya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"She is tall and slim. She has long straight hair and wears glasses.","id":"Dia tinggi dan langsing. Rambutnya panjang lurus dan dia memakai kacamata."},{"who":"Tom","en":"And what is she like?","id":"Dan bagaimana sifatnya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"She is smart, kind, and very funny!","id":"Dia pintar, baik hati, dan sangat lucu!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Penampilan dan sifat: **to be + adjective** → [[She is kind.]]","Ciri yang dimiliki: **has/have** → [[He has curly hair.]]","Kata sifat di depan benda dan tidak pakai -s: [[a big red bag]], [[two big bags]].","Urutan: **ukuran → umur → warna → benda**.","[[What does he look like?]] (penampilan) dan [[What is he like?]] (sifat)."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["kind","baik hati"],["lazy","malas"],["diligent","rajin"],["shy","pemalu"],["brave","berani"]],"exp":"Sifat bisa positif atau negatif; hafalkan keduanya.","k":"70281e9d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan warna dengan artinya:","pairs":[["green","hijau"],["yellow","kuning"],["brown","cokelat"],["purple","ungu"],["white","putih"]],"exp":"Warna sering dipakai bersama benda: a red bag.","k":"cdfef410"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She tall.","She is tall.","She are tall.","She has tall."],"answer":1,"exp":"She + is + adjective.","k":"3e4809cc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He is curly hair.","He have curly hair.","He has curly hair.","He are curly hair."],"answer":2,"exp":"Ciri yang dimiliki memakai has/have. He → has.","k":"280bd0c0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka baik hati.","q":"They ___ kind.","answers":["are"],"hint":"they → ...","exp":"They + are + adjective.","k":"8983288e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku punya rambut hitam.","q":"I ___ black hair.","answers":["have"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"I → have.","k":"63716f18"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kakakku berambut keriting.","q":"My sister ___ curly hair.","answers":["has"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"My sister = she → has.","k":"9dabd73b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Tas merah besar\" dalam bahasa Inggris adalah...","options":["a red big bag","a big red bag","a bag red big","a big bag red"],"answer":1,"exp":"Urutan: ukuran (big) → warna (red) → benda (bag).","k":"39255965"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"Dua kucing hitam kecil\".","options":["two smalls black cats","two small black cats","two black small cat","two cats small black"],"answer":1,"exp":"Adjective tidak berubah, dan bendanya jamak: cats.","k":"4faaec2d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia punya rambut panjang lurus.\"","answer":"She has long straight hair.","exp":"has + (panjang) + (lurus) + hair.","k":"7d1124ac"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Temanku sangat lucu.\"","answer":"My friend is very funny.","exp":"Subjek + is + very + adjective.","k":"a0081181"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Sebelum \"old bag\" kita pakai...","options":["a","an","the","some"],"answer":1,"exp":"Old dimulai bunyi huruf hidup (o), jadi an old bag.","k":"385d38c7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"What does she look like?\" dijawab dengan...","options":["She is tall and has long hair.","She is kind and funny.","She likes reading.","She is from Bandung."],"answer":0,"exp":"look like = penampilan.","k":"ab11cd60"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"What is he like?\" dijawab dengan...","options":["He is tall.","He has curly hair.","He is kind and friendly.","He wears glasses."],"answer":2,"exp":"What is he like? menanyakan sifat.","k":"8ea4962e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang dideskripsikan?","say":"She is tall and slim and she has long hair","options":["Dia tinggi, langsing, dan berambut panjang","Dia pendek dan berambut keriting","Dia tua dan pemalu","Dia lucu dan pintar"],"answer":0,"exp":"tall = tinggi, slim = langsing, long hair = rambut panjang.","k":"f46e03a2"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Warna apa?","say":"I have a purple bag","options":["Tas ungu","Tas hijau","Tas kuning","Tas cokelat"],"answer":0,"exp":"purple = ungu.","k":"050a2f2b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan penampilan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["tall","tinggi"],["short","pendek"],["slim","langsing"],["curly hair","rambut keriting"],["straight hair","rambut lurus"]],"exp":"Kosakata penampilan.","k":"054da5da"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan lawan kata:","pairs":[["big","small"],["new","old"],["long","short"],["lazy","diligent"]],"exp":"Lawan kata menambah kosakata.","k":"5344c32e"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["friendly","ramah"],["funny","lucu"],["polite","sopan"],["helpful","suka menolong"],["smart","pintar"]],"exp":"Sifat positif.","k":"c9de13b2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My mother has long hair.","My mother have long hair.","My mother is long hair.","My mother has a long hairs."],"answer":0,"exp":"My mother = she → has.","k":"6f444567"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["They are friendly.","They is friendly.","They has friendly.","They friendly are."],"answer":0,"exp":"They → are.","k":"caa14483"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She wears glasses.","She wear glasses.","She wearing glasses.","She is wear glasses."],"answer":0,"exp":"She → wears.","k":"78dc2bea"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan yang benar: \"kucing putih kecil\"","options":["a small white cat","a white small cat","a cat small white","small a white cat"],"answer":0,"exp":"ukuran → warna → benda.","k":"21cf6b23"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan yang benar: \"sepatu hitam baru\"","options":["new black shoes","black new shoes","shoes new black","black shoes new"],"answer":0,"exp":"umur (new) → warna (black) → benda.","k":"6b6bdf9d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih a atau an: \"___ ugly cat\"","options":["an","a","the","some"],"answer":0,"exp":"ugly dimulai bunyi vokal → an.","k":"a5e76ef7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih a atau an: \"___ big dog\"","options":["a","an","the","some"],"answer":0,"exp":"big dimulai konsonan → a.","k":"3df9f420"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"What color is your bag?\" dijawab...","options":["It's blue.","It's big.","It's new.","It's mine."],"answer":0,"exp":"color = warna.","k":"597a20d9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia memakai kacamata. (dia perempuan)","q":"She wears ___.","answers":["glasses"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"glasses = kacamata.","k":"dc6ae111"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kakakku sangat tinggi.","q":"My brother is very ___.","answers":["tall"],"hint":"t _ _ _","exp":"tall = tinggi.","k":"6dfa8f67"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka punya rambut hitam.","q":"They ___ black hair.","answers":["have"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"They → have.","k":"6504d7e1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kucing itu kecil.","q":"The cat is ___. (besar → kecil)","answers":["small"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"small = kecil.","k":"643b53f1"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia punya mata cokelat.\"","answer":"She has brown eyes.","exp":"She + has + brown eyes.","k":"d4e78a73"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Temanku sangat pintar.\"","answer":"My friend is very smart.","exp":"My friend + is + very + adjective.","k":"4160bb80"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Seperti apa penampilannya?\"","answer":"What does he look like?","exp":"What does he look like?","k":"4946f09e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang dideskripsikan?","say":"He is tall and he has short black hair","options":["Dia tinggi dan berambut hitam pendek","Dia pendek dan berambut keriting","Dia tua dan memakai kacamata","Dia kecil dan gemuk"],"answer":0,"exp":"tall, short black hair.","k":"db549238"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sifatnya?","say":"She is kind and helpful","options":["Baik hati dan suka menolong","Malas dan pemalu","Lucu dan pemberani","Sopan dan rajin"],"answer":0,"exp":"kind = baik hati; helpful = suka menolong.","k":"78d8e1c7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My cousin is Raka. He is thirteen. He is tall and thin. He has short curly hair. He is very funny.\" Seperti apa rambut Raka?","options":["Pendek dan keriting","Panjang dan lurus","Pendek dan lurus","Panjang dan keriting"],"answer":0,"exp":"short curly hair.","k":"3741a799"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Mimi is my cat. She is small and white. She has green eyes. She is lazy and likes sleeping.\" Apa sifat Mimi?","options":["Malas","Rajin","Pemalu","Berani"],"answer":0,"exp":"She is lazy.","k":"95467bb3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"I have a new bag. It is big and red. It has two pockets.\" Apa warna tas itu?","options":["Merah","Biru","Hijau","Hitam"],"answer":0,"exp":"red.","k":"27355e99"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What does your teacher look like?\" B: \"___\"","options":["She is tall and she wears glasses.","She is kind and friendly.","She is from Medan.","She is a teacher."],"answer":0,"exp":"look like → penampilan.","k":"44a3bd9b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What is your friend like?\" B: \"___\"","options":["He is funny and helpful.","He is tall and thin.","He has black hair.","He is wearing a jacket."],"answer":0,"exp":"like → sifat.","k":"8594ad26"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She has tall.","She is tall.","She has long hair.","She has brown eyes."],"answer":0,"exp":"tall dengan is.","k":"4a29c514"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I have a red big bag.","I have a big red bag.","She has a small white cat.","He has a new black bike."],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan: ukuran sebelum warna.","k":"8b6c7f16"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["They has black hair.","They have black hair.","She has black hair.","I have black hair."],"answer":0,"exp":"They → have.","k":"22f2d4b4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dia ramah dan baik hati\" adalah...","options":["She is friendly and kind.","She has friendly and kind.","She friendly kind.","She are friendly and kind."],"answer":0,"exp":"She is + adjective.","k":"8a19dd80"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Kucing putih kecil\" adalah...","options":["a small white cat","a white small cat","a cat small white","small a white cat"],"answer":0,"exp":"ukuran → warna.","k":"b6926759"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["glasses","kind","funny","polite"],"answer":0,"exp":"glasses = benda; lainnya sifat.","k":"00e31ca4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia pemalu.","q":"He is ___.","answers":["shy"],"hint":"s _ _","exp":"shy.","k":"fdd4ebc5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kakakku berambut lurus. (dia perempuan)","q":"My sister has ___ hair.","answers":["straight"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"straight.","k":"ed0416c5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka rajin.","q":"They are ___.","answers":["diligent"],"hint":"d _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"diligent.","k":"33126517"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tas itu berwarna ungu.","q":"The bag is ___.","answers":["purple"],"hint":"p _ _ _ _ _","exp":"purple.","k":"23ee8627"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia punya mata cokelat dan rambut hitam.\"","answer":"She has brown eyes and black hair.","exp":"She has + ... + and + ...","k":"fbb93640"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Guruku baik dan sopan.\"","answer":"My teacher is kind and polite.","exp":"My teacher + is + adjective + and + adjective.","k":"51a389a0"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang dideskripsikan?","say":"He is short and he has curly hair","options":["Dia pendek dan berambut keriting","Dia tinggi dan berambut lurus","Dia gemuk dan pemalu","Dia tua dan lucu"],"answer":0,"exp":"short; curly.","k":"35e937d6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sifatnya?","say":"She is polite and very smart","options":["Sopan dan sangat pintar","Malas dan lucu","Pemalu dan berani","Rajin dan ramah"],"answer":0,"exp":"polite; smart.","k":"1028027e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Seseorang bertanya, \"What does your sister look like?\" Jawabanmu yang paling tepat adalah...","options":["She is tall and has long hair.","She is kind and funny.","She likes swimming.","She is twelve years old."],"answer":0,"exp":"look like = penampilan.","k":"5a155487"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu ingin memuji temanmu yang suka menolong. Apa yang kamu katakan?","options":["You are very helpful!","You are very lazy!","You are very shy!","You are very short!"],"answer":0,"exp":"helpful.","k":"05d88746"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["beautiful","beatiful","beutiful","beautifull"],"answer":0,"exp":"beautiful.","k":"63a15f2c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["friendly","frendly","friendley","freindly"],"answer":0,"exp":"friendly.","k":"1b5e9b00"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["curly","curley","kurly","curli"],"answer":0,"exp":"curly.","k":"d03872c8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ color is your bag?\"","options":["What","Who","Where","How old"],"answer":0,"exp":"What color.","k":"f00a0257"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is she like?\" (Dia ramah.)","options":["What","Who","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"What is she like?","k":"b9409d7b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"He ___ a beard.\" (dia berjenggot)","options":["has","have","is","are"],"answer":0,"exp":"has.","k":"6fa9fd03"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"The girls ___ very polite.\"","options":["are","is","has","have"],"answer":0,"exp":"are.","k":"0ba2fb35"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan yang benar: \"anjing cokelat besar\"","options":["a big brown dog","a brown big dog","a dog big brown","big a brown dog"],"answer":0,"exp":"ukuran → warna.","k":"9067c582"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan yang benar: \"tas biru baru\"","options":["a new blue bag","a blue new bag","a bag new blue","new a blue bag"],"answer":0,"exp":"umur → warna.","k":"a22ca698"},{"type